# Functional dependency satisfaction (instance-based): Addable determines result type.
# fn@Integer on [+ n n] matches the FD-inferred type — no overbroad-annotation expected.
# Without FD improvement, the body infers as Unknown and the annotation triggers a warning.
[double: [fn@Integer [let n@Integer] [+ n n]]]
[double 5]
=== out
Int(10)
